WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.444
Retention and privacy.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.519
Retention is off until you turn it on,

3
00:00:06.519 --> 00:00:09.133
one kind of record at a time,

4
00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:12.631
and every schedule names its authority.

5
00:00:13.181 --> 00:00:16.659
See what is eligible before anything runs.

6
00:00:17.209 --> 00:00:20.783
A legal hold stops every deletion it covers,

7
00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:23.663
and always wins over a schedule.

8
00:00:24.213 --> 00:00:26.966
The privacy inventory is built from

9
00:00:26.966 --> 00:00:29.916
the live database each time it opens,

10
00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:33.116
so it cannot quietly stop being true.

11
00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:37.143
Export it for the privacy impact assessment.
